WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.300
[Music]

2
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.420
Hi, I'm Hayes.

3
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.100
I'm Amelia.

4
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:29.800
And I'm Reese.

5
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.400
And we're Chi Omega's recruitment chairs.

6
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.560
Welcome to Chi O!

7
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:45.100
[Music]

8
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.000
Hey, my name is Myers Foxworth,
and I'm this year's Chi Omega president.

9
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.085
We hope you're having a great Greek Day,

10
00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:53.120
and we can't wait to show
you what Tau is all about.

11
00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:02.000
[Music]

12
00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.775
Chi Omega is the largest
women's organization

13
00:01:04.775 --> 00:01:07.140
in the world and was established in 1895.

14
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.902
Our chapter was the first at Ole Miss,
and we're proud to say

15
00:01:10.902 --> 00:01:14.320
that Chi Omega Tau is the largest
chapter of Chi O nationally.

16
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:18.728
Our six founding purposes are
friendship, personal integrity,

17
00:01:18.728 --> 00:01:22.240
service to others, academic
and intellectual pursuits,

18
00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.960
campus and community involvement,
and career and personal development.

19
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.460
Chi Omega has been recognized
for academic excellence year after year,

20
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:32.440
consistently maintaining one
of the highest GPAs on campus.

21
00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.580
We encourage our active and new
members to pursue academic excellence

22
00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:39.300
by maintaining an average of a 3.0 GPA.

23
00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.140
Here you can see a breakdown
of our dues for the upcoming school year

24
00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.140
for active and new members of Chi Omega.

25
00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:49.340
In addition to academic excellence, we also
take pride in our involvement on campus.

26
00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:54.020
To name a few, our members are involved
in the Columns Society, Student Ambassadors,

27
00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:57.650
RebelTHON, Big Event, Student Athletics,

28
00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.960
Campus Ministries,
Women's Council and more.

29
00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.930
We are so proud to have had
our very own Adya Praveen

30
00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.900
get crowned Queen
in the 2025 Homecoming Court.

31
00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:12.460
Throughout the recruitment process, I was
able to see how strong Chi O truly is,

32
00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.760
and I knew that it was something
that I wanted to be a part of,

33
00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:19.560
and now it's so crazy because it's
something that I could never live without.

34
00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:23.960
Being here has made me realize that
Chi O truly does last a lifetime.

35
00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:28.720
I could have never imagined how these
past four years could have shaped me,

36
00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:32.580
and it's crazy to think that this is just
the beginning of my own Chi O journey.

37
00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:38.000
[Music]

38
00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.300
Hey, PC '26!

39
00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.240
I'm Bradley Carter.

40
00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.240
And I'm Lucy Huthnance.

41
00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.600
And we're your new member educators.

42
00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.300
Get ready for the best four years ever!

43
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.700
Come see for yourself!

44
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.300
[Music]

45
00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.932
Thank you so much for joining
us for a short glimpse

46
00:02:53.932 --> 00:02:56.540
into what makes life at Chi O
so sweet and so special.

47
00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.938
We are so excited for this
week, and we cannot

48
00:02:58.938 --> 00:03:01.000
wait to show you what
Chi O is truly all about.

49
00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.372
Before we go, we wanted
to share one more thing

50
00:03:03.372 --> 00:03:05.620
that sets the sisterhood apart:
the Chi O Symphony.

51
00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.896
One of the best ways
to describe our sisterhood

52
00:03:07.896 --> 00:03:09.200
is through the words of the Symphony,

53
00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.760
which details the ideals each
Chi Omega strives to embody.

54
00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.772
It's hard to explain the significance

55
00:03:14.772 --> 00:03:17.600
of our Symphony and exactly
how much it means to us,

56
00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.040
so we thought we would just show you.

57
00:03:19.400 --> 00:04:04.700
[Music]
